@startuml
title Use-Case Diagram - TravelWise (updated, as implemented)

left to right direction

actor Employee
actor Supervisor
actor Administrator
actor "Cost Prediction\nService (ML model)" as ML

rectangle "TravelWise System" {
  usecase "Login / Authenticate" as UC1
  usecase "Submit Travel Request" as UC2
  usecase "Predict Travel Cost" as UC3
  usecase "Generate Travel Options" as UC4
  usecase "Score and Recommend\nOptions" as UC5
  usecase "Approve or Reject\nRequest" as UC6
  usecase "View My Requests" as UC7
}

Employee --> UC1
Supervisor --> UC1
Administrator --> UC1

Employee --> UC2
Employee --> UC7
UC2 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC3 --> ML

Supervisor --> UC5 : reviews
Supervisor --> UC6

note right of UC6
  Administrator has no
  implemented use cases yet
  (Manage Policies / View
  Reports are design-only —
  see traceability matrix,
  status "Not met").
end note

@enduml
